Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:38.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}The joy of nature's dreams reaches its peak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:44.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}The Lord peers down through his window of eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:55.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Captive and oppressed, the people pass away without ever noting his existence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:01:05.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}As decreed by compassion, I can overcome my sins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:21.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Now watch as the sorrow of the world vanishes and rematerializes before our eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:27.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Strike the stake, strike the stake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:32.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Rend the dark night and bathe in moonlight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.60,0:01:40.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Thousands of iron hammers become thy pain
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Now thou art released
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:49.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Before long the screams flutter in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:54.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}And the night sky is dyed a brilliant red
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:02:00.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}The crossed stakes become your strength
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:06.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}And soon will you reach salvation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:27.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Stay faithful to the laws and principles tied to you without a contract
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:33.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}The earth raises no mountains that may fear fire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:38.80,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}But rather withers them away in their rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:49.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Zeal lies unprohibited, preventing me from ever forgetting the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:03:04.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Now watch as my denial makes the afterimage vanish and rematerialize before our eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:11.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Bite the sand, bite the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:16.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Bearing the pain as if it were childbirth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:24.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}The needle's arc as drawn by the compass morphs the emptiness into pleasure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:27.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Lifting us to heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:33.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Sever the sins of the coming world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:38.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Domesticate the flock of sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:44.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Should the song of thanks be rewarded
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:51.60,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Then hallelujah, give praise to The Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:06.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Lower the ramp of our mighty ark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:11.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Extend the sails and row as the legend had predicted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:23.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}If the destination of heaven is revealed, the people will flock there, and it will submerge
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:30.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Wear the blood, wear the blood
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:35.40,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Both the slaves and the livestock being guided
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:41.00,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}Don't reach forward if you hold any desire within
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:46.20,translation,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,25)\blur3}For all who disobey lose their way
